---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="What the Yes No Klub website collects about visitors, and how to opt out."
>
  <section>
    <div class="grid text-left lg:gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <h2
        class="mt-1 text-sm sm:text-2xl lg:text-right col-span-2 sm:col-span-3 lg:col-span-1"
      >
        What this site collects, in plain terms.
      </h2>
      <div class="col-span-2">
        <hr class="lg:hidden" />
        <h1>Privacy</h1>
        <hr />
        <div class="py-1">
          <h3>Visit statistics</h3>
          <p>
            This site uses Google Analytics to count visits and see which pages
            are read. It records pages viewed, approximate location, device and
            browser type, and how a visitor arrived. It uses cookies to tell
            visits apart. Google Analytics does not log or store IP addresses.
            It does not identify anyone by name, and Yes No Klub does not combine
            it with any other information about you.
          </p>
          <p>
            The data is held by Google, which may process it on servers around the
            world. It is kept for a limited period under
            Google's standard retention settings, then deleted. We use it only to
            understand how the site is used and to improve it. It is not used for
            advertising.
          </p>
          <h3>What we don't collect</h3>
          <p>
            There are no accounts, sign-up forms, comments or advertising on this
            site, and no other tracking tools. We do not sell or share personal
            information.
          </p>
          <h3>Opting out</h3>
          <p>
            You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, or install
            Google's
            <a
              href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">opt-out browser add-on</a
            >. The site works the same either way.
          </p>
          <h3>Email and other sites</h3>
          <p>
            If you email us, we keep your message only to reply to it. Links to
            Instagram, Facebook, YouTube, SoundCloud and other sites leave this
            one, and those services have their own privacy policies.
          </p>
          <h3>Photographs and flyers</h3>
          <p>
            This site documents past events, including photographs of performers
            and audiences. If you appear in an image and would like it removed or
            credited differently, <a
              href="mailto:y%65%73noklub@gmail%2E%63om"
              target="_self">get in touch</a
            > and we will deal with it promptly.
          </p>
          <h3>Questions</h3>
          <p>
            For any question about this page, <a
              href="mailto:y%65%73noklub@gmail%2E%63om"
              target="_self">get in touch</a
            >.
          </p>
          <h6>Last updated October 2026</h6>
        </div>
        <hr />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
